Adapted animation algorithms
===========================

termflix
--------
Upstream: https://github.com/paulrobello/termflix
Revision: f2f2a3abe818bc0f85986c66de5750ef13cd1e59
Source paths: src/animations/matrix.rs, src/animations/starfield.rs,
              src/animations/plasma.rs, src/animations/fire.rs
Adapted into: src/presets/matrix.rs, starfield.rs, plasma.rs, fire.rs

Adapted portions are the falling-stream/head/trail model, forward-depth
perspective model, overlapping spatial/temporal sine and cosine field, and
pull-from-below heat recurrence. This application replaces upstream terminal
transport, per-frame random draws and simulation timing with ASCII cells,
seeded state, accepted-time motion, local collision resolution and fixed fire
steps. No media assets, Unicode glyph catalogue, or terminal framework copied.
