TUIOS
-----
Upstream: https://github.com/Gaurav-Gosain/tuios
Revision: e57ecf3741f8884dd6d033b70188160965bd1a3d
Source path: internal/app/celebrate.go
Adapted into: src/presets/confetti.rs

Adapted portions are the upward launch cone and randomized velocity,
closed-form linear drag/gravity position, sideways wobble, staggered births,
1–1.5 second lifetimes, glyph fading, and 400-particle population ceiling.
The Preset repeats bursts on the shared simulation clock. ASCII glyphs
replace upstream Unicode shapes. No Bubble Tea scheduling, window-manager
behavior, terminal transport, or guided-tour integration copied.
