ttfx and TerminalTextEffects
---------------------------
Upstream: https://github.com/omacom/ttfx
Revision: 921bd551c308c235e01c5867f0199efe0691c271
Source paths: src/effects/decrypt.rs, src/effects/scattered.rs
Adapted into: src/presets/text_art.rs

Adapted portions are per-target ciphertext scenes with randomized discovery,
and random-start eased paths back to occupied target glyphs. The adaptation
uses the application's configured FIGlet bitmap and analytic age-based cells,
not the upstream effects engine. ttfx is a Rust port of TerminalTextEffects
by ChrisBuilds; both upstream attribution lines are retained below.
